info.description:
E-Commerce REST API built with Python (Starlette), gRPC, NSQ, PostgreSQL, and Redis

Every error uses the `ApiResponse` envelope with an `errors` array. Besides the responses listed for each endpoint:
- endpoints that need a token return 401 `UNAUTHORIZED` when it is missing or invalid, and 403 `FORBIDDEN` when the user's role is not allowed;
- rate-limited endpoints return 429 `RATE_LIMITED`;
- any request can return 500 `INTERNAL_ERROR`, or 504 `REQUEST_TIMEOUT` when it takes longer than `APP_REQUEST_TIMEOUT`.
